{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2011-09", "window": 1, "start_date": 1314835200, "end_date": 1315439999, "month_true_total": 361, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:44:50 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "277876", "author": {"steamid": "76561197967433737", "personaname": "a talking skeleton", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/a-talking-skeleton/", "num_games_owned": 1277, "num_reviews": 117, "playtime_forever": 613, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 580, "last_played": 1737358707, "avatar": "7f239c2dbd1c51c810d70218a1b380366c340a51"}, "language": "english", "review": "My jaw has not physically dropped while playing a game for years. \n\nThat has changed.", "timestamp_created": 1315439019, "timestamp_updated": 1315439019, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1721109", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996949435", "personaname": "KitchenBro", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197996949435/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 6785, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6712, "last_played": 1382946673, "avatar": "43f55cb68985fe001ae2fdfdcfd4c4a8c4f5b33c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really a lot of fun! Bashing, slashing and don't forget shooting... nice adaption of the well-known table top game.", "timestamp_created": 1315436393, "timestamp_updated": 1315436393, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2009112", "author": {"steamid": "76561198000892411", "personaname": "Miguel Myers", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198000892411/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1131, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 983, "last_played": 1432335767, "avatar": "96b52416977196b9805ba38cc88276a2e94490cb"}, "language": "english", "review": "For when you feel the need to rip something in half with a chainsaw sword!\n\n(And no that never gets old)", "timestamp_created": 1315435953, "timestamp_updated": 1315435953, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "915474", "author": {"steamid": "76561197981916773", "personaname": "Thanatov", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Thanatov/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 69, "playtime_forever": 975, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 975, "last_played": 1324627200, "avatar": "9de324b2f3b038205c99f91e5f775e658e9b96b8"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you are a fan of the 40k universe, this game will be like a dream come true for you.  In my opinion this game is easily one of the best games to use the license so far, and above all it proves that Relic isn't just capable of making great RTS games but also action games.  The action is a mix of gears of war and dynasty warriors, you'll be switching to melee to take out groups of enemies and then to ranged weapons to take out enemies at a distance.  Combat isn't terribly varied however and most encounters involve the same mixes of ranged and melee enemies.  The story is no different than any action movie/game and isn't really anything special, but the gameplay is what really keeps you going.  Above all the game really captures the essence of the 40k universe and the space marine's place in it.  YOU FEEL like a living breathing bad ass that everyone sees and either ♥♥♥♥♥ themselves or bows in respect.  The game also has multiplayer which i can go into later (out of space).", "timestamp_created": 1315435051, "timestamp_updated": 1385407378, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "547656", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971985579", "personaname": "MisterTomo", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197971985579/", "num_games_owned": 2009, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 2066, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2054, "last_played": 1418104275, "avatar": "e0f6cc56e83ced5871d72799afff2f1cdcbf90a2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Single player is very good.  Just remember that it's a melee game with shooting added.", "timestamp_created": 1315432418, "timestamp_updated": 1315432418, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}